            <div xml:id="d97">

                <pb facs="0195" n="93" sameAs="frus:frus1935v01/pg93"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">500.A15A5/457a: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Chargé in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Atherton</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1935-08-16T18:00:00-04:00">August 16, 1935—6
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>215. All the important news associations have reports from London that British
                    Government has extended invitations to Washington Treaty powers for informal
                    conference, London, about October. In reply to inquiries at press conference
                    today I have stated no such invitation has been received.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
